values
  ('AD', 'AD-IGI', 'Declaració-liquidació de l’impost general indirecte', array['month', 'quarter', 'half_year']::declaration_period[], null, date '2013-01-01', null, 'Llei 11/2012, article 78 — the period of the declaration-settlement depends on the net turnover of the previous year: below EUR 250,000 the settlements are made in July and January (semi-annual), below EUR 3,600,000 in April, July, October and January (quarterly), and monthly otherwise; the tax calendar of the Govern shows the same three cadences. The official model that carries the declaration (the tax calendar and the profession’s guides name it form 900, form 910 for the semi-annual filer) was not available as a readable text: the lines of this pack are its own layout, built from the elements the law sets (output tax by rate, deductible input tax, imports, exports, result). They are not the boxes printed on the form. The day by which the declaration must be filed is set by regulation, which was not found: the pack states no deadline.', true,null, null, null, null, null, null)
